    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scary Tales: Horror School \u2013 A Terrifying First-Person Horror Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in an <strong>abandoned school</strong> haunted by <strong>dark entities</strong>, you must <strong>find a way to escape</strong> before it\u2019s too late. <strong>Eerie corridors</strong>, <strong>spine-chilling whispers</strong>, and a <strong>sinister past</strong> lurk around every corner\u2014every step you take <strong>could be your last</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548950/extras/08b50ab41113e453ac054b0c1fd9143e.poster.avif?t=1745396158\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548950/extras/08b50ab41113e453ac054b0c1fd9143e.webm?t=1745396158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548950/extras/08b50ab41113e453ac054b0c1fd9143e.mp4?t=1745396158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Storyline - Chapter 1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once a cheerful schoolboy, enjoying <strong>carefree days of laughter and play</strong>. But one fateful mistake changed everything\u2014<strong>you stepped into a forbidden room</strong>, only to come face-to-face with an unspeakable <strong>evil</strong>. The last thing you remember is the <strong>horrifying figure of a devil</strong> before everything went dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you wake up in <strong>a locked, shadowy room</strong>, the air thick with whispers and unseen presences. The only way out? <strong>Solve the puzzles, navigate the nightmares, and escape the haunted school\u2026 or become another lost soul trapped within its walls.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features &amp; Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Three Destinations, Three Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Explore the haunted school and uncover <strong>three different escape routes</strong>. Each requires solving a <strong>unique puzzle</strong> to unlock its exit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Dynamic Challenges</strong> \u2013 Every destination presents a <strong>distinct horror experience</strong>, testing your ability to think fast, solve mind-bending puzzles, and <strong>survive relentless supernatural encounters</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Escape Possibilities</strong> \u2013 Whether you crack cryptic codes, <strong>piece together hidden clues</strong>, or <strong>outsmart otherworldly forces</strong>, your choices will determine your fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability &amp; Choice-Driven Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Each playthrough offers <strong>a new experience</strong>, as you decide <strong>which path to take and which horrors to face</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Escape\u2026 or Become Another Victim?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face your fears, solve the mysteries, and <strong>find your way out before the darkness consumes you</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Storyline - Chapter 2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Father enters a cursed school on a mission to rescue his missing son. The school has become a twisted nightmare, crawling with flesh-hungry zombies, deranged staff, and a brutal terror known as The Butcher\u2014a monstrous, chainsaw-wielding creature born of rage and violence. He doesn\u2019t speak. He hunts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548950/extras/fb70a7bf6d47dd3b8a50f9f6ccd2c8bd.poster.avif?t=1745396158\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548950/extras/fb70a7bf6d47dd3b8a50f9f6ccd2c8bd.webm?t=1745396158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548950/extras/fb70a7bf6d47dd3b8a50f9f6ccd2c8bd.mp4?t=1745396158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features &amp; Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Digit Code Puzzle: Explore the haunted school to uncover a hidden <strong>3-digit code</strong>\u2014the only way to open the final door and save your son. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon &amp; Tools: Scavenge for <strong>guns, grenades, and melee weapons</strong> scattered across classrooms and corridors. Use them wisely\u2014resources are limited, and danger is constant. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Butcher: A relentless horror with a roaring chainsaw. He can\u2019t be reasoned with\u2026 and he can\u2019t be stopped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undead Enemies:\u00a0Face off against zombies and corrupted faculty that roam the halls. Choose to fight, sneak, or flee\u2014each choice matters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Save The Son\u2026 or Become Another Victim?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Wishlist Now on Steam!</strong></p>",
